    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like that. it feels like i'm the only thing standing in the way of them being happy. like if i just wasn't part of the equation anymore, they could finally just breathe and not be constantly let down by me. it seems almost more compassionate to just... let them go, you know? to stop being the disappointment they have to deal with every single day. it feels like the only way to actually honor what they did for me is to stop making things harder for them.",
